batch_outputs:  [['91455.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 455 by 1 (ones place):**\n   - 455 × 1 = 455\n\n2. **Multiply 455 by 0 (tens place):**\n   - 455 × 0 = 0\n\n3. **Multiply 455 by 200 (hundreds place):**\n   - 455 × 200 = 91,000\n\n4. **Add all the results together:**\n   - 455 + 0 + 91,000 = 91,455\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe product of 455 and 201 is **91,455**.', '']]
