batch_outputs:  [['92340.\n\n**Step-by-Step Explanation:**\n\n1. **Multiply 405 by 8 (ones place):**\n   - 405 × 8 = 3,240\n\n2. **Multiply 405 by 20 (tens place):**\n   - 405 × 20 = 8,100\n\n3. **Multiply 405 by 200 (hundreds place):**\n   - 405 × 200 = 81,000\n\n4. **Add all the results together:**\n   - 3,240 + 8,100 + 81,000 = 92,340\n\n**Final Answer:**\nThe product of 405 and 228 is **92,340**.', '']]
